Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 11:58:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] controller: validate actual capacity on recovered volumes

Use the requested capacity range for cached and cloud-recovered volumes.
Reject incompatible existing disks before saving a record and report the
actual provider capacity after rounding instead of the requested size.

